# Only hide non-essential files that aren't needed for the TypeScript build.
# src/, tests/, tsconfig.json must remain visible so `tsc` can compile.
# Vercel serves ONLY the public/ directory (set in vercel.json outputDirectory).
# The compiled dist/ is ignored by Vercel because outputDirectory points to public/.
